WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.523
Welcome to Module 2: Components of AI Agents.

2
00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:07.890
Here we open up an agent and look at the parts that make it work.

3
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:17.830
You will learn what an AI agent is, describe nine components and how they connect, and build the core components yourself in short Python examples.

4
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:32.297
You will select each part of an interactive architecture diagram: perception, reasoning, planning, action, and tools, then memory, feedback and learning, safety and governance, and human oversight.

5
00:00:32.297 --> 00:00:34.950
Five Python examples bring them to life.

6
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:40.280
The key takeaway: the foundation model is only one component.

7
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.050
Reliability comes from the parts around it.
